    skos:definition "(2A) If:  (a) the Procedural Rules make provision for or in relation to a time limit for giving the information; and  (b) the carrier or provider does not give the Commission the information within that time limit; the Commission may, by written notice given to the carrier or provider, reject the undertaking."@en ;
