concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-7-sec-23 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 After section 152CD"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-23 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  Procedural Rules  Schedule 7  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Issues) Act 2005 No. 119, 2005            17 152CDA  Deferral of consideration of an access undertaking etc.  (1) The Procedural Rules may authorise the Commission to defer consideration of:  (a) an access undertaking; or  (b) a variation of an access undertaking.  (2) Subsection (1) has effect despite anything in this Division." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  Procedural Rules  Schedule 7  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Issues) Act 2005 No. 119, 2005            17 152CDA  Deferral of consideration of an access undertaking etc.  (1) The Procedural Rules may authorise the Commission to defer consideration of:  (a) an access undertaking; or  (b) a variation of an access undertaking.  (2) Subsection (1) has effect despite anything in this Division."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7be3cd00fa0072627ae0772d003ab27c5a7e945e372f6619c56d1a8fdbccbeda" ;
