concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-8-sec-45 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45 Definitions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-8-sec-45 ;
    values:originalText "In this Part: active declared service has the same meaning as in section 152AR of the Trade Practices Act 1974. designated interconnection service has the meaning given by clause 47. eligible service has the same meaning as in section 152AL of the Trade Practices Act 1974." ;
    skos:definition "In this Part: active declared service has the same meaning as in section 152AR of the Trade Practices Act 1974. designated interconnection service has the meaning given by clause 47. eligible service has the same meaning as in section 152AL of the Trade Practices Act 1974."@en ;
