doc:sch-11-sec-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "2 At the end of section 61" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (2) At any time after the last day on which a report of a subsection 61A(1) review was tabled in a House of the Parliament, the Minister may, by written instrument, declare that Part 8 of Schedule 1 ceases to have effect on a specified day. The specified day must not be earlier than the last day on which a resolution disallowing the declaration could have been passed by a House of the Parliament under section 42 of the Legislative Instruments Act 2003. Note: A subsection 61A(1) review must be conducted before 1 July 2009.  (3) A declaration under subsection (2) has effect accordingly.  (4) A declaration under subsection (2) is a legislative instrument for the purposes of the Legislative Instruments Act 2003." ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer .

