concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-11-sec-69a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "69A Remedial directions—breach by Telstra of conditions relating"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-69a ;
    values:originalText "to operational separation  (1) This section applies if Telstra has contravened, or is contravening, a condition set out in Part 8 of Schedule 1.  (2) The ACCC may give Telstra a written direction requiring Telstra to take specified action directed towards ensuring that Telstra does not contravene the condition, or is unlikely to contravene the condition, in the future.  (3) The following are examples of the kinds of direction that may be given to Telstra under subsection (2):  Schedule 11  Operational separation of Telstra" ;
    skos:definition "to operational separation  (1) This section applies if Telstra has contravened, or is contravening, a condition set out in Part 8 of Schedule 1.  (2) The ACCC may give Telstra a written direction requiring Telstra to take specified action directed towards ensuring that Telstra does not contravene the condition, or is unlikely to contravene the condition, in the future.  (3) The following are examples of the kinds of direction that may be given to Telstra under subsection (2):  Schedule 11  Operational separation of Telstra"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "96152a12e2b8c2dfdf4af489eea112cef6f33e09d86414f92cff65393c531089" ;
    cof:pageNumber "33"^^xsd:integer ;
