concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-11-sec-69b-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "69B(6) Review by the Australian Competition Tribunal of remedial"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-69b-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of a review by the Australian Competition Tribunal under this section, the member of the Tribunal presiding at the review may require the ACCC to give such information, make such reports and provide such other assistance to the Tribunal as the member specifies." ;
    skos:definition "(6) For the purposes of a review by the Australian Competition Tribunal under this section, the member of the Tribunal presiding at the review may require the ACCC to give such information, make such reports and provide such other assistance to the Tribunal as the member specifies."@en ;
