concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-11-sec-48-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "48(5) Aim and objects"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-48-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) In determining, for the purposes of paragraph (2)(d), the needs of Telstra’s wholesale customers in relation to eligible services, regard must be had to the following needs:  (a) the need for those customers to be supplied by Telstra with eligible services on a basis that allows fair competition with eligible services supplied by Telstra’s retail business units;  (b) the need for disputes between those customers and Telstra about eligible services to be resolved in a fair and timely manner;  (c) the need for confidentiality in relation to eligible services supplied by Telstra to those customers;  (d) the need to be kept informed of relevant issues and developments in connection with:  (i) Telstra’s network, in so far as it relates to the supply of eligible services; and  (ii) eligible services supplied by Telstra.  Schedule 11  Operational separation of Telstra" ;
    skos:definition "(5) In determining, for the purposes of paragraph (2)(d), the needs of Telstra’s wholesale customers in relation to eligible services, regard must be had to the following needs:  (a) the need for those customers to be supplied by Telstra with eligible services on a basis that allows fair competition with eligible services supplied by Telstra’s retail business units;  (b) the need for disputes between those customers and Telstra about eligible services to be resolved in a fair and timely manner;  (c) the need for confidentiality in relation to eligible services supplied by Telstra to those customers;  (d) the need to be kept informed of relevant issues and developments in connection with:  (i) Telstra’s network, in so far as it relates to the supply of eligible services; and  (ii) eligible services supplied by Telstra.  Schedule 11  Operational separation of Telstra"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3050cb02efc126f75f11a49bed87d63ed54ca230c2e2543b0e82cd95d9476f5a" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-11-sec-48 ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must consider the needs of wholesale customers in relation to eligible services." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
