    skos:definition "In this Part: business unit means a part of Telstra. declared network service has the meaning given by clause 50B. designated service has the meaning given by clause 50A. draft operational separation plan means a draft operational separation plan under Division 2. draft rectification plan means a draft rectification plan under"@en ;
