    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a declared network service is a service specified in a written determination made by the Minister under this subclause.  (2) A determination under subclause (1) is a legislative instrument for the purposes of the Legislative Instruments Act 2003." ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer .

