concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-11-sec-56 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56 Variation of final operational separation plan"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-56 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This clause applies if:  (a) a final operational separation plan is in force; and  (b) Telstra gives the Minister a draft variation of the plan.  (2) The Minister must:  (a) approve the variation; or  (b) refuse to approve the variation.  (3) In deciding whether to approve the variation, the Minister must have regard to the following matters:  Schedule 11  Operational separation of Telstra" ;
