concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-11-sec-62 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "62 Effect of approval"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-62 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the Minister approves a draft rectification plan, the plan becomes a final rectification plan. The final rectification plan comes into force at the time when Telstra is notified of the approval.  (2) A final rectification plan is not a legislative instrument for the purposes of the Legislative Instruments Act 2003." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If the Minister approves a draft rectification plan, the plan becomes a final rectification plan. The final rectification plan comes into force at the time when Telstra is notified of the approval.  (2) A final rectification plan is not a legislative instrument for the purposes of the Legislative Instruments Act 2003."@en ;
