doc:sch-11-sec-63-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "63(3) Variation of final rectification plan" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) In deciding whether to approve the variation, the Minister must have regard to the following matters:  (a) the extent to which the action proposed to be taken by Telstra under the plan as proposed to be varied will be likely to ensure that:  (i) the contravention ceases; and  (ii) there is no repetition of the contravention in the future;  (b) such other matters (if any) as are specified in a written determination made by the Minister under this paragraph." ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer .

