concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-11-sec-152eq a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "152EQ Operational separation for Telstra"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-152eq ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if Telstra has engaged in conduct in order to comply with a final operational separation plan in force under Part 8 of Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications Act 1997.  (2) In performing a function, or exercising a power, under this Part in relation to Telstra, the Commission must have regard to the conduct to the extent that the conduct is relevant.  Interim determinations about access  Schedule 12  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Issues) Act 2005 No. 119, 2005            47" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if Telstra has engaged in conduct in order to comply with a final operational separation plan in force under Part 8 of Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications Act 1997.  (2) In performing a function, or exercising a power, under this Part in relation to Telstra, the Commission must have regard to the conduct to the extent that the conduct is relevant.  Interim determinations about access  Schedule 12  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Issues) Act 2005 No. 119, 2005            47"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ba68886ff302ceecfd0dfc4f1b363d3f2f711f5fbf74018fddba7915f99a1395" ;
