concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-12-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 After subsection 152CPA(5)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-12-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (5A) The Commission may extend the period specified in an interim determination, so long as:  (a) the extension is for a period of not more than 12 months; and  (b) there has been no previous extension.  Schedule 12  Interim determinations about access" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (5A) The Commission may extend the period specified in an interim determination, so long as:  (a) the extension is for a period of not more than 12 months; and  (b) there has been no previous extension.  Schedule 12  Interim determinations about access"@en ;
